    {"\<\"cosmological metric: R^cd_ab is non-zero only for {c,d} = \
{a,b}\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"Einstein tensor: G^0_0 = 3Ha^2 + 12 Ha Hb + 6 Hb^2, G^1_1 = 2Ha' + \
