    {"\<\"generalized Kronecker delta: contraction identity delta^{m1..mp \
r}_{n1..np r} = (8-p) delta^{m1..mp}_{n1..np} (p = 1..4, 60 random index sets \
each)\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"generalized Kronecker delta with 9 upper indices vanishes in 8 \
