    {"\<\"variation of nL a^3 b^4 L_k: EL_nL = -2 a^3 b^4 E^(k)0_0, EL_a = -6 \
a^2 b^4 E^(k)1_1, EL_b = -8 a^3 b^3 E^(k)4_4 (k = 1..4)\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"inhomogeneous metric: nabla_mu E^(k)mu_nu == 0 EXACTLY at (x0, x4) \
