    {"\<\"cubic Lovelock Kasner: (p, q) = (-15/7, 20/7) solves E^(3) == 0; \
E^(3) == 0 identically for q = 0 and for p = 0\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"2x2 reduction: A, B, betaD square to ID16 and anticommute; Zc = \
