chi17 psi)^2, I_7 == -(axial invariant)\"\>", "True"},
    {"\<\"local Lorentz invariance: I_r(S psi, psibar S^-1) == I_r(psi, \
psibar) for r = 0..8 (random finite Lorentz transformation), and S^-1 == \
